#!/bin/bash
# Toggle the focused window in/out of a scratchpad (default: "scratchpad").
# If the window is already on that scratchpad, move it to the regular
# workspace visible on its monitor; otherwise move it into the scratchpad.
set -euo pipefail

name=${1:-scratchpad}

current=$(hyprctl activewindow -j | jq -r '.workspace.name // ""')
[ -n "$current" ] || exit 0

if [ "$current" = "special:$name" ]; then
  target=$(hyprctl monitors -j | jq -r '.[] | select(.focused) | .activeWorkspace.name')
  [ -n "$target" ] || exit 0
  hyprctl dispatch "hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = \"name:$target\" })"
else
  hyprctl dispatch "hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = \"special:$name\", follow = false })"
fi
